    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Easily manage <strong>WooCommerce payment gateways per product, category, or tag</strong> with this flexible <strong>Payments plugin</strong>. Gain full control over your checkout by selecting exactly which gateways—<strong>PayPal, Stripe, credit cards, and more</strong>—are available for each product or product group.</p>\n<p>Offer <strong>tailored checkout experiences</strong> that build trust, boost conversions, and give your customers the <strong>right payment options</strong> every time.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Assign unique payment gateways to individual products.<br />\n&#8211; Display default gateways when no product-specific ones are set.<br />\n&#8211; Enhance customer experience with <strong>custom checkout flows</strong>.<br />\n&#8211; Fully compatible with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight and optimized for performance.</p>\n<p>Unlock seamless checkout customization and deliver better shopping experiences with this must-have WooCommerce plugin.</p>\n<p><strong>Premium Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; <strong>Set payment gateways per product</strong> – Choose exactly which gateways (PayPal, Stripe, credit cards, etc.) are shown for each product.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Control gateways per category</strong> – Assign specific payment methods to entire product categories for easier management.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Tag-based payment rules</strong> – Configure gateways based on product tags, ideal for grouping products across categories.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Flexible checkout customization</strong> – Deliver tailored checkout experiences that boost conversions and customer trust.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Full compatibility with WooCommerce</strong> – Works seamlessly with all major gateways and extensions.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Increase sales &amp; reduce cart abandonment</strong> – Show only the most relevant and trusted payment methods to your customers.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Easy setup, no coding required</strong> – Intuitive interface that lets store owners configure rules quickly.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Advanced control &amp; flexibility</strong> – Combine product, category, and tag rules for maximum customization.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h3>Automatic Installation:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins &gt; Add New</strong> in your WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Search for <code>WooCommerce Payment Gateway Per Product</code>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then activate the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Manual Installation:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin ZIP file via the WordPress admin or FTP.</li>\n<li>Extract and place it in the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20happens%20if%20i%20add%20products%20with%20different%20payment%20gateways%20to%20the%20cart%3F'>\nWhat happens if I add products with different payment gateways to the cart?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Allowed payment gateways are prioritized over denied gateways. For example:<br />\n&#8211; Product 1: PayPal<br />\n&#8211; Product 2: PayPal + Credit Card<br />\nBoth gateways will be available at checkout.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20does%20this%20plugin%20benefit%20my%20woocommerce%20store%3F'>\nHow does this plugin benefit my WooCommerce store?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This plugin enables <strong>customized payment workflows</strong> for a tailored shopping experience, increasing conversion rates.</p>\n<p>For more details, visit <a href=\"http://www.dreamfoxmedia.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dreamfox Media</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>3.6.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.</li>\n<li>Update freemius SDK to 2.12.2</li>\n<li>Fixed bug using plugin on wordpress.com</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.6.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and compatibility updates.</li>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.</li>\n<li>Update freemius SDK to 2.12.1</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.6.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bugfix -&gt; Payment options not visible by product in free version</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.6.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bugfixes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.6.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update freemius SDK to 2.11.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security issues solved</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security issues solved</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and compatibility updates.</li>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.</li>\n<li>Update Freemius SDK to 10.2</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and compatibility updates.</li>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&#8230; (keep existing changelog entries here) &#8230;</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Boost flexibility in WooCommerce by enabling custom payment gateways per product, category, or tag, giving your customers the right payment options at &hellip;",
    "description": "<p>Easily manage <strong>WooCommerce payment gateways per product, category, or tag</strong> with this flexible <strong>Payments plugin</strong>. Gain full control over your checkout by selecting exactly which gateways—<strong>PayPal, Stripe, credit cards, and more</strong>—are available for each product or product group.</p>\n<p>Offer <strong>tailored checkout experiences</strong> that build trust, boost conversions, and give your customers the <strong>right payment options</strong> every time.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Assign unique payment gateways to individual products.<br />\n&#8211; Display default gateways when no product-specific ones are set.<br />\n&#8211; Enhance customer experience with <strong>custom checkout flows</strong>.<br />\n&#8211; Fully compatible with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight and optimized for performance.</p>\n<p>Unlock seamless checkout customization and deliver better shopping experiences with this must-have WooCommerce plugin.</p>\n<p><strong>Premium Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; <strong>Set payment gateways per product</strong> – Choose exactly which gateways (PayPal, Stripe, credit cards, etc.) are shown for each product.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Control gateways per category</strong> – Assign specific payment methods to entire product categories for easier management.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Tag-based payment rules</strong> – Configure gateways based on product tags, ideal for grouping products across categories.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Flexible checkout customization</strong> – Deliver tailored checkout experiences that boost conversions and customer trust.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Full compatibility with WooCommerce</strong> – Works seamlessly with all major gateways and extensions.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Increase sales &amp; reduce cart abandonment</strong> – Show only the most relevant and trusted payment methods to your customers.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Easy setup, no coding required</strong> – Intuitive interface that lets store owners configure rules quickly.<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Advanced control &amp; flexibility</strong> – Combine product, category, and tag rules for maximum customization.</p>\n",
